		{"id":"83d73fee3a852dbc","type":"text","text":"B STORY","x":-400,"y":200,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"34a469d0310f9129","type":"text","text":"FUN AND GAMES","x":-400,"y":290,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3d91b50fab75253c","type":"text","text":"MIDPOINT","x":-400,"y":370,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e2c061086dd0a4aa","type":"text","text":"ACT 2 B","x":60,"y":430,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d61f4c089ab67420","type":"text","text":"BAD GUYS CLOSE IN","x":-400,"y":540,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e9576c69b9a85902","type":"text","text":"ALL IS LOST","x":-400,"y":630,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"17255d217f4813f5","type":"text","text":"DARK NIGHT OF THE SOUL","x":-400,"y":720,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1f27a6a92d40e5ac","type":"text","text":"Dharma is directionless this ruins his life","x":960,"y":-480,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3d0bdab2eddc0e57","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20250822144829.png","x":900,"y":-1040,"width":400,"height":319},
		{"id":"082c10931977744a","type":"text","text":"Everyday, Dharma always put others need before his own, ","x":960,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a0a369e64a579314","type":"text","text":"Dharma is always put into a situation that he doesn't like","x":960,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c1dbbbd59cef4f23","type":"text","text":"One day, Dharma is asked to duet as a Pianist in a competition. which is a situation that he doesn't like but accepted","x":960,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7dde8c9633d3d74b","type":"text","text":"Dharma's Character Arc","x":960,"y":-560,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b6b50b49ba60d216","type":"text","text":"Because of that, Dharma met Nadia, who unlike him, does what she expected because she have to","x":960,"y":0,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"931ce4358fa57721","type":"text","text":"Dharma realises his previledge of choice that he never took, after meeting Nadia.","x":960,"y":160,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cd654186f7a6f438","type":"text","text":"Dharma then says that he wants to be the best, first, by doing the best as the Main Instrument in the duet","x":960,"y":320,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"deff743a9710fef9","type":"text","text":"Dharma, now determined by ACTION, practices, and become good at the Piano","x":960,"y":480,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"757c0940dae7e344","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, he is able to win the Final Competition","x":960,"y":640,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"75772cd3d29fee50","type":"text","text":"Eversince then, Dharma has a direction in life, he choses to go to UI as a Geography Major, which is a major not wanted by his parents, but he wants.","x":960,"y":780,"width":250,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6d3b5868951acb5b","type":"text","text":"Nadia's Character Arc","x":1780,"y":-480,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"23d62883b3c3877f","type":"text","text":"Nadia is a strict and ambitious girl with one direction in her life, she has no time to smell the roses","x":1780,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fc182d1e2d0c144f","type":"text","text":"Everyday, she studies, practices, competes, to the point she had zero to no friends. Her friends don't know her closely","x":1780,"y":-220,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"32ed532ac9010b50","type":"text","text":"One day, with no choice of Accompanist, she took on the only pianist left in her school","x":1780,"y":-20,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1f27dc2190286213","type":"text","text":"Because of that, Nadia met Dharma, who is a relaxed and someone who enjoys life.","x":1780,"y":150,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"faaed1effbaff452","type":"text","text":"Nadia realise that the End is not as much important as the moments leading to it, she learns to enjoy the journey","x":1780,"y":310,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3ad1a1a9cdf3b074","type":"text","text":"Nadia began enjoying the small things in life","x":1780,"y":480,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"61ab7e6fc6700e79","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, she decides that she still want to fulfill her parents wish, but with something that benefits her too, (She studies great, but in Spain, which is her dream country)","x":1780,"y":590,"width":250,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4b26a5b184d93d97","type":"text","text":"Eversince then, Nadia looks brighter, she smiles more and laughs more, she enjoys life more.","x":1780,"y":860,"width":250,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cdd02084f03472d4","type":"text","text":"Dharma is directionless this ruins his life","x":-120,"y":-420,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b2b72dd3a53828d1","type":"text","text":"BREAK INTO 3","x":-400,"y":980,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f16c686934156d3f","type":"text","text":"FINALE","x":-400,"y":1080,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a61135ee6b8ee113","type":"text","text":"FINAL IMAGE","x":-400,"y":1180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2d242e2be817f777","type":"text","text":"Eversince then, Dharma has a direction in life, he choses to go to UI as a Geography Major, which is a major not wanted by his parents, but he wants.","x":185,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"40826581c8be0a38","type":"text","text":"Eversince then, Nadia looks brighter, she smiles more and laughs more, she enjoys life more.","x":-120,"y":905,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"1"},
